  "description": "The Uwell Caliburn G4 Pro Koko Pod Vape Kit combines compact design with advanced functionality, offering a full touchscreen interface, 2000mAh battery, and a choice of three output modes. Designed for mouth-to-lung (MTL) and restricted direct-to-lung (RDL) vaping, it delivers up to 35W of power through a simple, draw-activated system. Its Smart Mode automatically selects the best wattage for your pod, while additional settings let you choose between Storm Mode for maximum output, Waves Mode for a smoother ramp-up, or Custom Mode to create your own power curve. The touchscreen display keeps all your essential information clear and accessible, from wattage to battery level. Compatible with Uwell Caliburn G3 pods, the G4 Pro Koko includes two 2ml refillable pods with built-in mesh coils for fast, even heating and rich flavour. Refilling is quick and mess-free via the top-fill port, while adjustable airflow allows you to fine-tune your draw. Fast USB-C charging restores around 80% power in under an hour, ensuring dependable all-day performance. Shop our e-juice UK collection and find the perfect partner for this kit. We Recommend using 50/50 ( Freebase) or Nic Salts E-LIquid with this kit. Please Note: Uwell Caliburn G3 0.4ohm pods are low resistance pods with a maximum output of 25w and are not sutied for high VG E-Liquid When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
